A||N||9||fropuff||Got my lights in!!!||||10||
Z||000000||fropuff||08-18-2000||09:20 AM||||To those who care and would like to know, I got my back-up lights in yesterday.  I got the idea from DXR_DAD (Thanks DXR.)  I put some in my GT fastback.  But, I put them in to work in sync with the others.  Work and look nice!  I think they will look a lot better when I spray some tint on them to make them darker.  I also got the idea to tint the side marker lights.  From MonkeyMan I think it was.  Sorry if I'm not right. <BR>     The process went very slowly.  A lot of fishing around wire and for wire.  To anyone who wants to try this mod, I do highly suggest that you take off the rear fascia first.  Will make it a lot easier and will cut down a lot of time.  When you're done, though, your car will look even better!!!<BR>     I'll post some pics of my freshly-painted 1986 Fiero GT Fastback soon.  Gotta take some first!    <BR> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||Monkeyman||08-18-2000||09:23 AM||||I don't have any of my light tinted, but I do have my tail lights lightly sprayed with paint.  Makes it look like they aren't there.||||reg||1
Z||000002||fropuff||08-18-2000||09:26 AM||||That was fast!  Do your lights look good?  I was thinking of painting mine, but with this spray, you can be a little more careful.  Do your lights go against any laws or anything?  I don't think they would.  It's not like I'm spray painting the headlights and windshield.  Just side markers and back-ups.  Thanks.||||reg||10
Z||000003||DXR_DAD||08-18-2000||10:28 AM||||Good job Puff!, glad your all done. Come on with the pics!!!!!. YES a lot of snaking the<BR>wires!!!!!. I just hooked a switch to mine so I can turn them on at will.  <BR>*DON"T TAIL GATE ME*!!!!  Glad to be of some help to ya!!!!!<P>DXR_DAD||||reg||14
